    "Nicht mehr in der Mediathek" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No longer in the library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nach der Unterbrechung war nicht sicher, ob Fotos schon einsortiert waren. Albumist fügt sie nicht von selbst hinzu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After the interruption it was unclear whether photos were already sorted in. Albumist does not add them on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Album hattest du inzwischen gelöscht. Albumist legt es nicht wieder an." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You had deleted an album in the meantime. Albumist does not create it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Am %@ teilweise rückgängig gemacht" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partly undone on %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nicht alles ließ sich rückgängig machen. Du kannst es noch einmal versuchen oder es so lassen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not everything could be undone. You can try again or leave it as it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rest rückgängig machen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Undo the Rest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Macht nur rückgängig, was noch von Albumist ist. Was du inzwischen selbst geändert hast, bleibt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only undoes what is still Albumist's. What you changed yourself in the meantime stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Albumist konnte deine Alben gerade nicht lesen. Versuche es gleich noch einmal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Albumist couldn't read your albums just now. Please try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das unterbrochene Anlegen zählt, sobald du oben entschieden hast." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interrupted album creation counts once you have decided above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das unterbrochene Entfernen zählt, sobald du oben entschieden hast." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interrupted removal counts once you have decided above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das unterbrochene Rückgängigmachen zählt, sobald du oben entschieden hast." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interrupted undo counts once you have decided above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neue Alben liegen in Fotos unter Sammlungen › Alben." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New albums are in Photos under Collections › Albums."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wartet, bis der Akku lädt" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waiting for the battery to charge"
