          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Names as they were when the albums were created. Albumist respects what you changed in Photos afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entfernt nur die neuen Alben und Zuordnungen dieser Änderungen. Deine Fotos bleiben." : {
